            Token auth method:
                        Periodic token: vault token create -policy=hcvop -period=24h (no max ttl here, You can renew a periodic token an infinite number of times)
                        Create a Use-Limited Token: vault token create -policy="hcvop" -use-limit=2 (after 2 uses it will be automatically revoked)
                        Create a Orphan Token: vault token create -policy="hcvop" -orphan (n HashiCorp Vault, an orphan token is a token that has no parent token. The main benefit is that it is not automatically revoked when the token that created it expires or is revoked)
